{"id":"607388","name":"酱油炒饭","author":"优子家的味道","authorId":"9910251","desc":"","cover":"images/607388/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"葱花。","img":"images/607388/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋。","img":"images/607388/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"黄瓜、胡萝卜切丁。","img":"images/607388/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"米饭。","img":"images/607388/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"米饭中倒入两勺酱油。","img":"images/607388/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一勺蚝油。","img":"images/607388/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/607388/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"鸡蛋打入碗中。","img":"images/607388/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"油热倒入蛋液。","img":"images/607388/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"用筷子顺着一个方向迅速搅拌。","img":"images/607388/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"鸡蛋成型后倒入拌好的米饭。","img":"images/607388/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"将米饭炒散。","img":"images/607388/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入黄瓜、胡萝卜丁。","img":"images/607388/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"炒断生。","img":"images/607388/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入味精、葱花。","img":"images/607388/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"炒匀出锅。","img":"images/607388/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"美味漂亮，营养丰富，孩子的最爱！","img":"images/607388/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"胡萝卜丁提前焯一下水，防止炒出来夹生影响口感。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}